@startuml UC-27 Reply to Blog Comment - Sequence Diagram
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #000000
skinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor #000000
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 280
title UC-27 Reply to Blog Comment — Sequence Diagram

actor Teacher
participant ":BlogCommunityPage" as UI
participant ":BlogController" as CTL
participant ":BlogCommentService" as SVC
participant ":BlogPostRepository" as PREPO
participant ":BlogCommentRepository" as CREPO
database DB

autonumber
Teacher -> UI : Click "Trả lời" on a root comment
activate UI
UI --> Teacher : Show the reply banner naming the author of the root comment
Teacher -> UI : Enter the reply text and click "Send"
UI -> UI : addComment()
UI -> CTL : POST /api/blog-posts/{id}/comments with parentCommentId
activate CTL
CTL -> SVC : create(postId, content, parentCommentId)
activate SVC

SVC -> PREPO : findPublishedById(postId)
activate PREPO
PREPO -> DB : SELECT * FROM blog_posts WHERE id = ? AND status = 'PUBLISHED'
activate DB
DB --> PREPO : row / none
deactivate DB
PREPO --> SVC : Optional<BlogPost>
deactivate PREPO

SVC -> CREPO : findById(parentCommentId)
activate CREPO
CREPO -> DB : SELECT * FROM blog_comments WHERE id = ?
activate DB
DB --> CREPO : row / none
deactivate DB
CREPO --> SVC : Optional<BlogComment>
deactivate CREPO

alt the post is no longer published or the reply target is not a root comment of that post
  SVC --> CTL : ResourceNotFoundException / IllegalArgumentException
  CTL --> UI : HTTP 404 / 400
  UI --> Teacher : Show that the reply cannot be posted and keep the typed text

else the reply target is a valid root comment of the published post
  SVC -> SVC : sanitize the reply text and reject it when empty or over 200 words
  SVC -> CREPO : save(comment)
  activate CREPO
  CREPO -> DB : INSERT INTO blog_comments with parent_comment_id set to the root comment
  activate DB
  DB --> CREPO : Saved
  deactivate DB
  CREPO --> SVC : BlogComment
  deactivate CREPO
  SVC --> CTL : CommentView
  CTL --> UI : HTTP 201 + CommentView
  UI --> Teacher : Show MSG08, reload the discussion and display the reply nested under the root comment
end

deactivate SVC
deactivate CTL
deactivate UI
@enduml
